      "Defensive cover percentages and evasion modifiers per cell",
      "Relic resonance affinities (Lux or Tenebris environmental surges)"
    ],
    "invariants": [
      "Zero dynamic heap allocation during terrain loading (ALLOC_ZERO_HEAP)",
      "Passable cell movement friction strictly >= 1.0 (prevents free movement)",
      "Defensive cover modifiers bounded within [0, 100] percent",
      "Line-of-sight occlusion strictly evaluated per cell type"
    ]
